[11.909534, "o", "sistencies whenever possible (example: passing `repo_type` in the\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    `repo_id` is forbidden).\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    Rules:\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    - Between 1 and 96 characters.\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    - Either \"repo_name\" or \"namespace/repo_name\"\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    - [a-zA-Z0-9] or \"-\", \"_\", \".\"\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    - \"--\" and \"..\" are forbidden\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    Valid: `\"foo\"`, `\"foo/bar\"`, `\"123\"`, `\"Foo-BAR_foo.bar123\"`\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    Not valid: `\"datasets/foo/bar\"`, `\".repo_id\"`, `\"foo--bar\"`, `\"foo.git\"`\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    Example:\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    ```py\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    >>> from huggingface_hub.utils import validate_repo_id\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    >>> validate_repo_id(repo_id=\"valid_repo_id\")\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    >>> validate_repo_id(repo_id=\"other..repo..id\")\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    huggingface_hub.utils._validators.HFValidationError:"]
[11.909559, "o", " Cannot have -- or .. in repo_id: 'other..repo..id'.\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    ```\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    Discussed in https://github.com/huggingface/huggingface_hub/issues/1008.\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    In moon-landing (internal repository):\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    - https://github.com/huggingface/moon-landing/blob/main/server/lib/Names.ts#L27\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    - https://github.com/huggingface/moon-landing/blob/main/server/views/components/NewRepoForm/NewRepoForm.svelte#L138\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n    \u001b[33m    \"\"\"\u001b[39;49;00m\u001b[90m\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n        \u001b[94mif\u001b[39;49;00m \u001b[95mnot\u001b[39;49;00m \u001b[96misinstance\u001b[39;49;00m(repo_id, \u001b[96mstr\u001b[39;49;00m):\u001b[90m\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n            \u001b[90m# Typically, a Path is not a repo_id\u001b[39;49;00m\u001b[90m\u001b[39;49;00m\r\n            \u001b[94mraise\u001b[39;49;00m HFValidationError(\u001b[33mf\u001b[39;49;00m\u001b[33m\"\u001b[39;49;00m\u001b[33mRepo id must be a string, not \u001b[39;49;00m\u001b[33m{\u001b[39;49;00m\u001b[96mtype\u001b[39;49;00m(repo_id)\u001b[33m}\u001b[39;49;00m\u001b[33m: \u001b[39;49;00m\u001b[33m'\u001b[39;49;00m\u001b[33m{\u001b[39;49;00mrepo"]
